      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n1. Slack Credentials: Add Slack OAuth2 API credentials with permissions for:\n\n        * channels:read (to access channel information)\n        * chat:write (to post messages)\n        * chat:write.public (to post in public channels)\n\n2. Perplexity API: Add Perplexity API credentials with your API key\n\n3. Anthropic API: Add Anthropic API credentials with your Claude API key\n\n4. Slack Trigger Configuration:\n\n        * Select the specific Slack channel to monitor for video ideas\n        * Configure webhook URL in your Slack app settings\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\n* Post a video idea message in the configured Slack channel\n* The workflow will automatically trigger and generate comprehensive YouTube content\n* Results will be posted as a threaded reply with formatted sections for research, titles, descriptions, tags, and outlines",
